OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in direct cremations
OL,4,Asince pandemic
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "A funeral is a ceremony...a
OL,7,Ffarewell, a celebration... it is for
OL,8,Ffor those left behind," he said. But,
OL,9,Fhe said, direct cremation came after
OL,10,FCovid when "the model became acceptable
OL,11,Fand practical", as well as being
OL,12,Fcheaper.
OL,14,FSunLife's 2026 Cost of Dying Report
OL,15,Ffound direct cremation was now chosen
OL,16,Ffor around one in five funerals in the
OL,17,FUK.
